WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.062
In under two minutes, you will review the homes your neighbors entered.

00:00:04.062 --> 00:00:05.079
We start on the map.

00:00:05.981 --> 00:00:09.313
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.073 --> 00:00:13.496
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.496 --> 00:00:15.985
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:15.985 --> 00:00:17.331
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:21.291
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:21.943
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.486 --> 00:00:27.982
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:27.982 --> 00:00:29.199
See the three dots?

00:00:29.199 --> 00:00:29.747
Tap them.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.313
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:35.008 --> 00:00:35.637
Tap Mine.

00:00:35.637 --> 00:00:37.585
These are the contests you run.

00:00:39.263 --> 00:00:41.286
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:41.286 --> 00:00:42.654
This is your dashboard.

00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:45.324
Tap Entries.

00:00:45.324 --> 00:00:48.045
Nothing goes on the map until you approve it.

00:00:49.857 --> 00:00:52.887
Tap Approve to put a home in the contest, and on the map.

00:00:54.766 --> 00:00:56.926
Tap Decline if an entry does not fit.

00:00:58.653 --> 00:00:59.851
A window asks why.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:03.508
The reason is optional, and it is emailed to the entrant.

00:01:03.508 --> 00:01:04.644
Tap Decline entry.

00:01:07.162 --> 00:01:08.246
Changed your mind?

00:01:08.246 --> 00:01:09.786
Tap Restore to put it back.

00:01:11.676 --> 00:01:14.997
Next up: Edit your contest and change the dates.
